			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 10140401,
					"content": "不错，这正是「涤尘铃」…嗯，保管得还真不错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10140402,
					"content": "我们顺便把之前做好的香膏也安放了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140403,
						10140405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10140403,
					"content": "你认识萍姥姥？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10140404,
					"content": "自然是认识的，不然我怎么会知道，这枚铃铛在她那？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10140407,
					"content": "嗯…疑点重重！但你不想说的话，我们也就先不追问了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10140408,
					"content": "对了，那位婆婆让我们带句话给你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10140409,
					"content": "「有空的话，过来喝喝茶也是可以的。老婆子我没什么家当，但总归还是有盏茶壶的。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10140410,
					"content": "哈哈哈，这语气可不太适合你。不过，她的茶壶确实很不错，用来泡茶再好不过了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10140411,
					"content": "等到了合适的时候，我自然会带着好茶…去见她的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10140412,
					"content": "那么，仪式下一项准备，该是什么了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10140413,
					"content": "嗯，下一项…我们去买<color=#00E1FFFF>风筝</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10140414,
					"content": "风筝！钟离要带我们去玩风筝了吗？这算是…中场休息？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10140415,
					"content": "哈哈，不是那样。风筝虽说是孩子的玩具，但在璃月的种种仪式上，还有其它象征意义。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10140416,
					"content": "我会为你们解释的。但我们接下来的行动，还是先去把风筝买到手再说。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10140417,
					"content": "唔…好吧，一头雾水…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10140405,
					"content": "你也是仙人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10140406,
					"content": "仙人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10140407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				}
			]
		},
